[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0010","text":"（──哦\n　手偶，越做越好了）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0020","text":"（两个人都很用心在做──\n　……呵呵。孩子们也会很高兴的吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0030","text":"你们可真好啊\n能被人打扮得这么可爱──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0040","text":"“嗯！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0050","text":"！！！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0060","text":"『大哥哥，你想和我们聊天吗？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0070","text":"啊啊啊，不，那个……！\n完全就是在自言自语，怎么说呢──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0080","text":"『自言自语！　那样多寂寞呀\n　对吧？　狗狗』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0090","text":"『嗯……\n　一起聊聊天吧……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0100","text":"……说、说得也是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20700100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
